OL,3,A'No excuse' for threatening behaviour
OL,4,Aor disruption, says minister after
OL,5,Asmall boats protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds blocked roads in the city
OL,8,Fafter about 120 migrants were brought
OL,9,Fto shore
OL,11,FThere was a similar protest in Dover on
OL,12,FSaturday - the BBC's Daniel Sandford
OL,13,Flooks at what connects the two events
OL,15,FAlso in the Commons, shadow home
OL,16,Fsecretary Chris Philp says the right to
OL,17,Fprotest "should never be violently
OL,18,Fexercised"
